  "display_title": "Beyond Memory",
  "description": "Won-Jun is a university student who can read other people’s emotions by touching them. He hears that Gyu-Han, who he shares lectures with, graduated from the same high school and decides to approach him. However, Gyu-Han gives him the cold shoulder, and no matter how hard Won-Jun tries, he can’t seem to read Gyu-Han’s feelings. But instead of chasing him away, Gyu-Han’s reaction to Won-Jun’s touches piques his curiosity instead and makes him continue his efforts all the more!\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS, edited)",
